# How it works
## Services
The stack contains the following services:
- nginx
- frontend (Next.js)
- backend (Nest.js)
- pgdb (Postgres database)
- vault (HashiCorp Vault)

## Volumes
The stack contains the following volumes:
- srcs_vault_data
- srcs_vault_logs
- srcs_certs_data
- srcs_pgdb_data
- srcs_modsecs_logs

